  "body": "### What happened\n\nLine from README is, \"Post: Fanuc, Haas, Mazak, Sinumerik, Heidenhain and Fanuc Lathe, written as scriptable .cps post processors. The setup sheet and tool list print alongside.\"\n\nI have not seen any setup sheets nor tool lists.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open README to see Tormach is not listed.\n2. Post. There should be more than the gcode file created. The setup sheet with setups, operations, and tools should be created in a separate file.\n\n### camcraft version and OS\n\nmac\n\n### Screenshots or recording\n\nI don't see Help->About anywhere. That might be another bug.\n\n<img width=\"1392\" height=\"944\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0cf05f6-596b-4dc5-ab53-085e524dfd3e\" />",
